                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "rag_top_k": 3
    },
    "predicted_behavior": "Trusted, in-scope, entity-matching RAG evidence now outranks untrusted high-overlap documents, so authority-tier and composition answers cite the correct trusted source; rag_top_k=3 ensures the authoritative doc is retained alongside supporting docs. Transient tool errors are retried up to max_attempts while permanent errors stop immediately, recovering live-registry tokens on first retry.",
    "regression_risk": "Raising rag_top_k to 3 adds one extra context item, slightly increasing prompt size and possible distractor noise; trust weighting could demote a legitimately untrusted-but-relevant doc if trust is mislabeled. Retry change may add one extra tool call on transient errors, marginally increasing latency but bounded by max_attempts=3."
